        "clauseId": "BIN-ASHOK:REQ-001",
        "sourceId": "code:src:App.jsx",
        "line": 177,
        "quote": "  }, [result]);",
        "message": "Plan row BIN-ASHOK:REQ-001 names src/App.jsx and says to use the active value while a number is being entered, otherwise the evaluated result. This handler reads only result. For example, entering 2 and activating Binary before pressing equals reads the initial result 0 and reports unsupported rather than converting the displayed positive whole number. Thus an implementation can follow the existing converted-result test yet fail the planned current-display behavior."
      },
      {
        "id": "BIN-ASHOK-IMPL-REQ001-ACTIVE-TEST",
        "severity": "blocking",
