        "clauseId": "BIN-ASHOK:REQ-001",
        "sourceId": "code:src:App.test.jsx",
        "line": 136,
        "quote": "    const user = userEvent.setup();",
        "message": "The planned src/App.test.jsx test only exercises conversion after equals (line 141 presses Enter before Binary), so it does not prove conversion of the current entered/displayed value before evaluation. The uncovered case exposes the same REQ-001 gap: the implementation reads the stale result rather than the active expression."
      }
